WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.316
- [Rehab Worker] Hi Klaus

00:00:01.316 --> 00:00:04.316
(soft violin music)

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.390
(package slams)

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.031
We'll see you soon Klause

00:00:10.031 --> 00:00:13.210
(coin dings)

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.863
Stay sober!

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:21.402
- I could've, cleared my schedule.

00:00:21.402 --> 00:00:22.760
(laughs at self)

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:23.843
Sober up!

00:00:23.843 --> 00:00:26.510
(face slapping)

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:29.213
Come on!

00:00:30.069 --> 00:00:31.549
It's so,

00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:33.070
(items crash)

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.215
touching, all that stuff
about family, and dad,

00:00:36.215 --> 00:00:37.119
time--

00:00:37.119 --> 00:00:39.619
(swing music)

00:00:40.953 --> 00:00:43.617
(grunts)

00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:46.700
(sirens in distance)

00:00:47.933 --> 00:00:51.433
(instrumental rock music)

00:00:54.392 --> 00:00:56.892
(breathes in)

00:00:58.951 --> 00:01:00.951
(sighs)

00:01:03.578 --> 00:01:04.411
(shouts out)

00:01:04.411 --> 00:01:06.444
- Klaus, what are you doin' in here?

00:01:06.444 --> 00:01:08.337
- Oh, Allison,

00:01:08.337 --> 00:01:09.170
Ah!

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.526
Number three, get out of his chair.

00:01:13.526 --> 00:01:14.780
(laughs)

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:18.387
(swings and hits)

00:01:18.387 --> 00:01:19.220
Hit him!

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.711
It's just like old times,

00:01:23.711 --> 00:01:26.294
(rain falling)

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:34.650
best funeral ever.

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:36.120
- [Allison] Is that my skirt?

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:39.410
- What? Oh yeah, this,
I found it in your room,

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:42.900
it's a little dated, I know,
but it's very breathe-y

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:44.360
on the bits.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:45.368
- Listen up.

00:01:45.368 --> 00:01:46.860
- (gurgling) Oh! Quelle surprise!

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:49.070
- I know you don't like
to do it, but I need

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:50.133
you to talk to dad.

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:52.000
(snorts)

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.427
I can't just call dad in
the afterlife and be like

00:01:55.427 --> 00:01:58.220
"Dad, could you just
stop playing tennis with

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.390
Hitler for a moment
and take a quick call?"

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:01.630
- Since when, that's your thing?

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:04.060
- I'm not in the right frame of mind.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:04.893
- You're high?

00:02:04.893 --> 00:02:05.726
- (laughs) Yeah!

00:02:05.726 --> 00:02:07.370
Yeah, I mean, how are you not?

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:08.881
Listening to this nonsense?

00:02:08.881 --> 00:02:10.890
(laughs) Manifesting!

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:12.730
Come on, chop chop!

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:15.680
You always were a stubborn bastard!

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:19.089
I don't know about you,
but I need a drink.

00:02:19.089 --> 00:02:20.708
(crashes)

00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:23.883
(laughs) Oh, oh.

00:02:24.771 --> 00:02:28.521
("Sinnerman" by Nina Simone)

00:02:32.443 --> 00:02:33.276
(men shouting)

00:02:33.276 --> 00:02:35.823
(guns fire)

00:02:35.823 --> 00:02:39.482
♪ Oh, sinnerman, where you gonna run to ♪

00:02:39.482 --> 00:02:42.673
♪ Sinnerman where you gonna run to ♪

00:02:42.673 --> 00:02:44.132
- I'm going out there.

00:02:44.132 --> 00:02:46.605
♪ Where you gonna run to ♪

00:02:46.605 --> 00:02:48.637
♪ All on that day ♪

00:02:48.637 --> 00:02:51.289
♪ Will I run to the rock ♪

00:02:51.289 --> 00:02:54.589
♪ Please hide me, I run to the rock ♪

00:02:54.589 --> 00:02:57.218
♪ Please hide me, run to the rock ♪

00:02:57.218 --> 00:02:58.163
(guns firing)

00:02:58.163 --> 00:03:00.089
♪ Please hide me lord ♪

00:03:00.089 --> 00:03:02.138
♪ All on that day ♪

00:03:02.138 --> 00:03:04.567
♪ But the rock cried out ♪

00:03:04.567 --> 00:03:09.150
♪ I can't hide you, the rock cried out ♪

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.370
(muffled screaming)

00:03:17.887 --> 00:03:20.337
(muffled talking)

00:03:20.337 --> 00:03:21.937
- [Man in Suit] What's he saying

00:03:22.849 --> 00:03:23.682
(duct tape rips)

00:03:23.682 --> 00:03:24.547
- Oh.

00:03:24.547 --> 00:03:25.380
- [Woman In Suit] What are you saying?

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:28.343
- You guys are scarier without the masks.

00:03:29.849 --> 00:03:31.370
(smacking)

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.203
No, no.

00:03:38.056 --> 00:03:40.473
(door slams)

00:03:48.706 --> 00:03:52.206
(suspenseful music rises)

00:03:55.253 --> 00:03:57.336
(grunts)

00:04:01.643 --> 00:04:03.643
(sighs)

00:04:04.652 --> 00:04:06.735
(laughs)

00:04:07.729 --> 00:04:09.729
(sighs)

00:04:16.783 --> 00:04:17.616
(locks open)

00:04:17.616 --> 00:04:18.449
("Mary" by Big Thief)

00:04:18.449 --> 00:04:22.009
♪ Burn up with the water ♪

00:04:22.009 --> 00:04:27.009
♪ The floods are on the plains ♪

00:04:28.004 --> 00:04:32.329
♪ The planets in a rose ♪

00:04:32.329 --> 00:04:36.729
♪ Who knows what they contain ♪

00:04:36.729 --> 00:04:41.729
♪ And my brain is like an orchestra ♪

00:04:43.012 --> 00:04:47.421
♪ Playing on, insane ♪

00:04:47.421 --> 00:04:52.421
♪ Will you love me like you
loved me in the January rain ♪

00:04:53.496 --> 00:04:56.124
- [Klaus Narrating] His name was Dave.

00:04:56.124 --> 00:04:57.440
- Yeah shit's crazy, I know.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.550
- Yeah.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:04:59.383
- You'll adjust.

00:05:01.001 --> 00:05:01.834
I'm Dave.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:04.720
- Klaus.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:05.992
- [Klaus Narrating] We soldiered together

00:05:05.992 --> 00:05:08.358
in the A Shau Valley

00:05:08.358 --> 00:05:10.991
in the Mountain of the Crouching Beast.

00:05:10.991 --> 00:05:13.324
(guns fire)

00:05:18.269 --> 00:05:19.102
- Medic!

00:05:20.763 --> 00:05:22.280
Medic!

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.180
Dave!

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.527
Look at me, look at me!

00:05:26.527 --> 00:05:27.360
Oh Damnit.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.193
Medic!

00:05:32.816 --> 00:05:35.791
Look at me, look at me, hey hey hey.

00:05:35.791 --> 00:05:38.291
Hey, hey, it's okay, hey, hey.

00:05:42.911 --> 00:05:45.118
Please stay with me Dave, please, please.

00:05:45.118 --> 00:05:46.951
No, no no no no no no.

00:05:52.655 --> 00:05:54.322
Oh, my god, hi Dave,

00:05:57.009 --> 00:05:57.842
it worked,

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:00.058
Dave.

00:06:00.981 --> 00:06:01.960
What happened here?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.630
- You look like shit.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.490
- Oh why thank you, hey where you going?

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:06.323
- Nope.

00:06:06.323 --> 00:06:07.156
- What?

00:06:08.269 --> 00:06:09.114
- I'm not giving you a ride.

00:06:09.114 --> 00:06:11.184
- Come on, man, you know I can't drive.

00:06:11.184 --> 00:06:12.017
- I don't--

00:06:12.017 --> 00:06:12.894
("Happy Together" by The Turtles)

00:06:12.894 --> 00:06:16.030
- Okay, great, I'll just
get my things, two minutes.

00:06:18.441 --> 00:06:20.691
(gunshots)

00:06:22.469 --> 00:06:23.788
(grunts)

00:06:23.788 --> 00:06:24.931
See?

00:06:24.931 --> 00:06:26.402
You used to think I was an idiot.

00:06:26.402 --> 00:06:29.069
- I still think you're an idiot.

00:06:33.974 --> 00:06:34.807
Go faster!

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:39.020
(gunshots)

00:06:40.328 --> 00:06:41.759
♪ and ease my mind ♪

00:06:41.759 --> 00:06:45.735
♪ Imagine how the world
could be, so very fine ♪

00:06:45.735 --> 00:06:50.735
♪ So happy together ♪

00:06:50.977 --> 00:06:55.528
♪ I can't see me lovin' nobody but you ♪

00:06:55.528 --> 00:06:57.705
♪ For all my life ♪

00:06:57.705 --> 00:06:59.084
(car engine screeches)

00:06:59.084 --> 00:07:04.084
♪ When you're with me,
baby the skies'll be blue ♪

